// Mental models (knowledge pages) for memd.
//
// A mental model is a Markdown page synthesized from a bank's memories for a source query, organized in
// folders and kept fresh by refresh jobs. A refresh is agentic (the reflect loop) or single-shot (one
// recall plus one SYNTHESIZE / MENTAL_MODEL_DELTA call), and full or delta. Refreshes of one model never
// overlap; a model has at most one queued refresh, and a failed refresh pauses automatic triggers until a
// manual refresh succeeds. This file holds MentalModelService, page search and the refresh trace.

